{{Quote|Allows the user to exhale clouds of explosive gas and transform into a powerful gaseous knight.|Shop}}
'''Gas''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|3,200,000}} or {{Robux|2,500}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Gas allows the user to create, become, and manipulate concentrated and flammable gas, unleashing devastating attacks against unfortunate foes. Additionally, the user can even transform into a Gas-Depicted [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knight knight].[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knight#HeroSection]

